      <h2>16. Ethical &amp; Legal Boundaries of OSINT</h2>
      <p>OSINT is powerful, and with power comes responsibility. The most professional investigators — in law
        enforcement, cybersecurity, or journalism — operate within strict ethical and legal frameworks. This section is
        not optional reading.</p>

